{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/extras/f9c6317ea97f1cc409d14767e9ed6f4c.avif?t=1768688401\" width=1200 height=250 /></span>Foster cats in this cozy 2D cat simulation game.  <br> <br>Keep an eye on their <strong>hunger, happiness, cleanliness, and sleep</strong> to make sure they stay healthy and content. <br>Play <strong>mini-games to earn money</strong>\u00a0then spend your earnings in the <strong>shop</strong> to buy food, toys and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your cat\u2019s ready, send them on <strong>adventures</strong> to discover rare items, gear, and treasures \u2014 from shiny accessories to legendary collars! <br><br>Once the cat is ready they will go to their forever home - as you level up you will unlock new cats, with new goals and new personalities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Adoption Tales has charming 2D visuals, relaxing music, and endless ways to interact.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/extras/2cc29afd408bf5954c226a3973c257b4.avif?t=1768688401\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foster cats:</strong> Foster a cat, help it meet its goals to get them ready for adoption.\u00a0<br><br><strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Earn $ to spend in the shop and boost your cat\u2019s stats with simple mini-games.<br><br><strong>Shop &amp; Inventory:</strong> Buy food, toys,  or collect rare adventure rewards.<br><br><strong>Adventure System:</strong> Send your cat exploring when you are AFK or before you close the game - or send them on quick mini adventures for an instant reward.\u00a0<br><br><strong>Clean:</strong> Manage cleanliness and keep the house free of poop.<br><br><strong>Cozy &amp; Relaxing:</strong> A gentle 2D world designed for unwinding at your own pace. No harsh penalties if you miss a day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wholesome Vibes:</strong> No timers, no stress \u2014 just you, a cat and some goals to tick off when you are ready.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091580?t=1768688401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/1ce4c6106cfe278f948e2b5d29e27d7383302fe9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768688401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/1caab123d574c1f7848ed3263ecc44e703717116/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768688401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/1caab123d574c1f7848ed3263ecc44e703717116/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768688401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4236120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/extras/f9c6317ea97f1cc409d14767e9ed6f4c.avif?t=1768688401\" width=1200 height=250 /></span>Foster cats in this cozy 2D cat simulation game.  <br> <br>Keep an eye on their <strong>hunger, happiness, cleanliness, and sleep</strong> to make sure they stay healthy and content. <br>Play <strong>mini-games to earn money</strong>\u00a0then spend your earnings in the <strong>shop</strong> to buy food, toys and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your cat\u2019s ready, send them on <strong>adventures</strong> to discover rare items, gear, and treasures \u2014 from shiny accessories to legendary collars! <br><br>Once the cat is ready they will go to their forever home - as you level up you will unlock new cats, with new goals and new personalities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Adoption Tales has charming 2D visuals, relaxing music, and endless ways to interact.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/extras/2cc29afd408bf5954c226a3973c257b4.avif?t=1768688401\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foster cats:</strong> Foster a cat, help it meet its goals to get them ready for adoption.\u00a0<br><br><strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Earn $ to spend in the shop and boost your cat\u2019s stats with simple mini-games.<br><br><strong>Shop &amp; Inventory:</strong> Buy food, toys,  or collect rare adventure rewards.<br><br><strong>Adventure System:</strong> Send your cat exploring when you are AFK or before you close the game - or send them on quick mini adventures for an instant reward.\u00a0<br><br><strong>Clean:</strong> Manage cleanliness and keep the house free of poop.<br><br><strong>Cozy &amp; Relaxing:</strong> A gentle 2D world designed for unwinding at your own pace. No harsh penalties if you miss a day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wholesome Vibes:</strong> No timers, no stress \u2014 just you, a cat and some goals to tick off when you are ready.</p>","developers":["Closed Forum"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/ce99ce5c8051d1f435f83cadb7a3cb38de5255b8/header.jpg?t=1768688401","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4091580/956267928/975fe60210e58197d539605fa26d459c5afbb314/1764794653/dash